// Errands (docs/runbooks/errands.md): plugins/jorah-errands. DRAFT: not applied.
// scripts/pc/install-errands.sh applies it, after linking the plugin, adding its six tools to main's
// live tool list and price_compare to deep's (never a fixed copy of either list here), and adding
// the plugin to plugins.allow. The guard needs this commit's permission-matrix.json (it reads it at
// start, so the script restarts the Gateway).
//
// stateDir holds the supplies record, which may hold a prescription: private, on the PC only,
// mode 700, never in the repo or docs/evidence. Outside the workspace on purpose, so file tools can't
// write it past the guard. In the daily backup's plugin-state tar once the 2026-11-17
// deploy/jorah-backup.service is installed (docs/runbooks/jorah-on-pc.md, "Daily backup").
//
// Dry run on the PC: install-errands.sh --dry-run. Undo: install-errands.sh --undo.
{
  plugins: {
    entries: {
      "jorah-errands": {
        enabled: true,
        config: {
          stateDir: "/home/jorah/.jorah-errands",
          timeZone: "Europe/Bratislava",
          remindTime: "09:00",
        },
      },
    },
  },
}
